  "id": "peanut-butter-mousse",
  "name": "Peanut Butter Mousse",
  "subtitle": "A quick, creamy single-serving dessert",
  "description": "Warm peanut butter briefly, blend it with sweetened yogurt and vanilla, then finish with chocolate chips for an easy mousse-style treat.",
